@startuml
title User Service - Background Session Cleanup

autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

control "Application Lifespan\napp/main.py" as App
control "Authentication\napp/auth.py" as Auth

App -> Auth: cleanup_sessions() at service startup
activate Auth
Auth --> App: Number of unusable sessions removed
deactivate Auth

loop Once per hour
  App -> Auth: cleanup_sessions()
  activate Auth
  alt Cleanup succeeds
    Auth --> App: Number of sessions removed
  else Cleanup fails
    Auth --> App: Cleanup error
    note right of App
      Record the failure and keep the
      service running until the next pass.
    end note
  end
  deactivate Auth
end

note over App,Auth
  Authentication rejects expired or revoked sessions
  immediately. Cleanup only removes obsolete records.
end note

@enduml
